"use strict";(globalThis.webpackChunkcasbin_website||=[]).push([[763],{7362(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"archive":{"blogPosts":[{"id":"aws-visual-asset-management-system-casbin","metadata":{"permalink":"/tr/blog/aws-visual-asset-management-system-casbin","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2026-11-01-aws-visual-asset-management-system-casbin.md","source":"@site/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2026-11-01-aws-visual-asset-management-system-casbin.md","title":"AWS, G\xf6rsel Varl\u0131k Y\xf6netim Sisteminde Apache Casbin\'i Nas\u0131l Kullan\u0131yor","description":"AWS\'nin a\xe7\u0131k kaynakl\u0131 G\xf6rsel Varl\u0131k Y\xf6netim Sistemi, API rotas\u0131 kontrollerinden nesne d\xfczeyi eri\u015fime kadar iki katmanl\u0131 ABAC/RBAC izin modeli i\xe7in pycasbin kullan\u0131yor.","date":"2026-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"casbin","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/casbin"},{"inline":true,"label":"aws","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/aws"},{"inline":true,"label":"abac","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/abac"},{"inline":true,"label":"rbac","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/rbac"},{"inline":true,"label":"adopters","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/adopters"}],"readingTime":1.97,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Yang Luo","title":"Creator of Casbin","url":"https://github.com/hsluoyz","imageURL":"/tr/img/authors/hsluoyz.png","key":"hsluoyz","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"AWS, G\xf6rsel Varl\u0131k Y\xf6netim Sisteminde Apache Casbin\'i Nas\u0131l Kullan\u0131yor","description":"AWS\'nin a\xe7\u0131k kaynakl\u0131 G\xf6rsel Varl\u0131k Y\xf6netim Sistemi, API rotas\u0131 kontrollerinden nesne d\xfczeyi eri\u015fime kadar iki katmanl\u0131 ABAC/RBAC izin modeli i\xe7in pycasbin kullan\u0131yor.","slug":"aws-visual-asset-management-system-casbin","authors":["hsluoyz"],"tags":["casbin","aws","abac","rbac","adopters"]},"unlisted":false,"nextItem":{"title":"Casbin\'i (Go) v2\'den v3\'e Y\xfckseltme: Tam Kapsaml\u0131 Ge\xe7i\u015f Rehberi","permalink":"/tr/blog/upgrading-casbin-go-v2-to-v3"}},"content":"[AWS Visual Asset Management System (VAMS)](https://github.com/awslabs/visual-asset-management-system), fiziksel AI i\xe7in g\xf6rsel varl\u0131klar\u0131 y\xf6netmek ve da\u011f\u0131tmak amac\u0131yla AWS\'nin a\xe7\u0131k kaynak platformudur. AWS, VAMS 2.0\'\u0131 yay\u0131nlad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda Cognito gruplar\u0131n\u0131 Casbin tabanl\u0131 bir ABAC/RBAC izin sistemiyle de\u011fi\u015ftirdi. Yak\u0131n zamanda duyurulan [2.6 s\xfcr\xfcm\xfc](https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/physical-ai/visual-asset-management-system-2-6-release/) ayn\u0131 tasar\u0131m\u0131 koruyor ve \xfczerine merkezi bir API yetkilendiricisi ekliyor.\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\n## \u0130ki katman, tek enforcer {#two-tiers-one-enforcer}\\n\\nVAMS her API iste\u011fini iki ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z katmana kar\u015f\u0131 kontrol eder. Katman 1, kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n rol\xfcn\xfcn u\xe7 noktay\u0131 \xe7a\u011f\u0131r\u0131p \xe7a\u011f\u0131ramayaca\u011f\u0131na karar verir ve HTTP metodunu rota yoluyla kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r. Katman 2, bu rol\xfcn belirli nesne \xfczerinde i\u015flem yap\u0131p yapamayaca\u011f\u0131na karar verir ve metodu `databaseId`, `assetName` ve `tags` gibi varl\u0131k nitelikleriyle kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r. Her iki katman\u0131n da iste\u011fe izin vermesi gerekir. Birinden biri reddederse, \xe7a\u011fr\u0131 reddedilir.\\n\\nBackend, [pycasbin](https://github.com/casbin/pycasbin) kullan\u0131yor. Her kullan\u0131c\u0131, bellek i\xe7i bir modelden ve string adapt\xf6r\xfcnden olu\u015fturulmu\u015f bir `FastEnforcer`\'\u0131 saran bir `CasbinEnforcer` al\u0131r. Politika, DynamoDB\'de saklanan kullan\u0131c\u0131 rollerinden ve k\u0131s\u0131tlamalar\u0131ndan \xe7al\u0131\u015fma zaman\u0131nda olu\u015fturulur ve kullan\u0131c\u0131 ba\u015f\u0131na 60 saniye \xf6nbelle\u011fe al\u0131n\u0131r. Politika al\u0131namazsa, enforcer ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z olmak yerine hepsini reddeden (deny-all) bir politikaya geri d\xf6ner.\\n\\nModelin e\u015fle\u015ftiricisi `g(r.sub, p.sub) && eval(p.obj_rule) && r.act == p.act` oldu\u011fundan, bir rol\xfcn k\u0131s\u0131tlamalar\u0131 bir kaynak ve eylem i\xe7in nesne d\xfczeyi ifadeyi ta\u015f\u0131yabilir. Casbin\'in rol ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 kullan\u0131c\u0131dan role e\u015flemesini y\xf6netir ve k\u0131s\u0131tlamalar ABAC k\u0131sm\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar.\\n\\n## 2.6 s\xfcr\xfcm\xfcnde neler de\u011fi\u015fti {#what-changed-in-26}\\n\\n2.6 s\xfcr\xfcm\xfc, API katman\u0131 i\xe7in tek bir merkezi yetkilendirici ekler ve daha \xf6nce bireysel handler\'larda bulunan \xe7ok fakt\xf6rl\xfc ve istem bilgisi mant\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 birle\u015ftirir. Ayr\u0131ca geli\u015fmi\u015f AWS IAM rol \xf6zelle\u015ftirmesi ve Cognito OIDC federasyonu ekler. Yetkilendirme modelinin kendisi de\u011fi\u015fmedi: Casbin h\xe2l\xe2 iki katman\u0131 de\u011ferlendiriyor ve \xf6zel Lambda yetkilendiricileri \xfczerine IP k\u0131s\u0131tlamalar\u0131 ekleyebiliyor.\\n\\nVAMS dok\xfcmantasyonu, tam modeli, nesne t\xfcrlerini ve k\u0131s\u0131tlama alanlar\u0131n\u0131 [Permissions Model](https://github.com/awslabs/visual-asset-management-system/blob/main/documentation/docusaurus-site/docs/concepts/permissions-model.md) sayfas\u0131nda a\xe7\u0131klar. Enforcer uygulamas\u0131 ise [authz mod\xfcl\xfcndedir](https://github.com/awslabs/visual-asset-management-system/blob/main/backend/backend/handlers/authz/__init__.py).\\n\\n## Daha fazla bilgi {#learn-more}\\n\\n- [AWS blog: Visual Asset Management System 2.6 release](https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/physical-ai/visual-asset-management-system-2-6-release/)\\n- [VAMS on GitHub](https://github.com/awslabs/visual-asset-management-system)\\n- [Apache Casbin adopters](https://casbin.apache.org/docs/adopters)\\n\\nAWS, Apache Casbin\'i kullanan bir\xe7ok organizasyondan biridir. Projeniz Casbin kullan\u0131yorsa, onu adopters listesine eklemekten memnuniyet duyar\u0131z."},{"id":"upgrading-casbin-go-v2-to-v3","metadata":{"permalink":"/tr/blog/upgrading-casbin-go-v2-to-v3","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2026-02-01-upgrading-casbin-go-v2-to-v3.md","source":"@site/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2026-02-01-upgrading-casbin-go-v2-to-v3.md","title":"Casbin\'i (Go) v2\'den v3\'e Y\xfckseltme: Tam Kapsaml\u0131 Ge\xe7i\u015f Rehberi","description":"\xdcretim ortam\u0131nda Casbin v2 \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131yorsan\u0131z ve v3\'e y\xfckseltme yolunu merak ediyorsan\u0131z, bu rehber sizin i\xe7in. De\u011fi\u015fenleri anlamaktan g\xfcvenli bir \xfcretim ortam\u0131 ge\xe7i\u015fi ger\xe7ekle\u015ftirmeye kadar ge\xe7i\u015f hakk\u0131nda bilmeniz gereken her \u015feyi ele alaca\u011f\u0131z.","date":"2026-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"casbin","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/casbin"},{"inline":true,"label":"go","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/go"},{"inline":true,"label":"migration","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/migration"},{"inline":true,"label":"upgrade","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/upgrade"},{"inline":true,"label":"v3","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/v-3"}],"readingTime":7.21,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Yang Luo","title":"Creator of Casbin","url":"https://github.com/hsluoyz","imageURL":"/tr/img/authors/hsluoyz.png","key":"hsluoyz","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Casbin\'i (Go) v2\'den v3\'e Y\xfckseltme: Tam Kapsaml\u0131 Ge\xe7i\u015f Rehberi","slug":"upgrading-casbin-go-v2-to-v3","authors":["hsluoyz"],"tags":["casbin","go","migration","upgrade","v3"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"AWS, G\xf6rsel Varl\u0131k Y\xf6netim Sisteminde Apache Casbin\'i Nas\u0131l Kullan\u0131yor","permalink":"/tr/blog/aws-visual-asset-management-system-casbin"},"nextItem":{"title":"2025\'te Casbin: Yapay Zeka Ajan \xc7a\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in Yetkilendirme","permalink":"/tr/blog/casbin-2025-ai-agent-era"}},"content":"\xdcretim ortam\u0131nda Casbin v2 \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131yorsan\u0131z ve v3\'e y\xfckseltme yolunu merak ediyorsan\u0131z, bu rehber sizin i\xe7in. De\u011fi\u015fenleri anlamaktan g\xfcvenli bir \xfcretim ortam\u0131 ge\xe7i\u015fi ger\xe7ekle\u015ftirmeye kadar ge\xe7i\u015f hakk\u0131nda bilmeniz gereken her \u015feyi ele alaca\u011f\u0131z.\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\n## v3\'te Ne De\u011fi\u015fti? {#what-changed-in-v3}\\n\\n\u0130yi haber \u015fu: **v3 \xf6ncelikle tam geriye d\xf6n\xfck uyumlulu\u011fa sahip bir mod\xfcl yolu de\u011fi\u015fikli\u011fidir**. Temel yetkilendirme mant\u0131\u011f\u0131, API\'ler ve i\u015flevsellik de\u011fi\u015fmeden kal\u0131r. Bu, Go\'nun semantik versiyonlama kurallar\u0131na uyarken kesintiyi en aza indirmek i\xe7in bilin\xe7li bir karard\u0131.\\n\\n### Ana De\u011fi\u015fiklik: Mod\xfcl Yolu {#the-main-change-module-path}\\n\\nv3\'teki tek k\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 de\u011fi\u015fiklik Go mod\xfcl yoludur:\\n\\n```go\\n// v2\\nimport \\"github.com/casbin/casbin/v2\\"\\n\\n// v3\\nimport \\"github.com/casbin/casbin/v3\\"\\n```\\n\\nHepsi bu kadar. Mevcut politikalar\u0131n\u0131z, modelleriniz ve kod mant\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n de\u011fi\u015fmesine gerek yok. Ge\xe7i\u015f mekanikseldir: import ifadelerini ve go.mod dosyan\u0131z\u0131 g\xfcncelleyin.\\n\\n### Neden v3 S\xfcr\xfcm\xfc Yay\u0131nland\u0131? {#why-release-v3}\\n\\nSadece bir import yolu de\u011fi\u015fikli\u011fi i\xe7in neden yeni bir ana s\xfcr\xfcm yay\u0131nland\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 merak ediyor olabilirsiniz. Cevap semantik versiyonlamad\u0131r. Go\'nun mod\xfcl sistemi, import yolunda ana s\xfcr\xfcm numaras\u0131n\u0131 (`/v2`, `/v3` vb.) kullan\u0131r. Bu, \xe7ok say\u0131da ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131\u011fa sahip b\xfcy\xfck uygulamalarda kritik olan birden fazla ana s\xfcr\xfcm\xfcn ayn\u0131 ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131k a\u011fac\u0131nda bir arada bulunmas\u0131na olanak tan\u0131r.\\n\\nv3\'\xfc yay\u0131nlayarak \u015funlar\u0131 yapt\u0131k:\\n- Go\'nun semantik import versiyonlamas\u0131 ile hizaland\u0131k\\n- Karma\u015f\u0131k ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131k grafiklerinde kademeli ge\xe7i\u015fi etkinle\u015ftirdik\\n- Mevcut v2 kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 k\u0131rmadan gelecekteki iyile\u015ftirmeler i\xe7in zemin haz\u0131rlad\u0131k\\n\\n## Ne De\u011fi\u015fmedi? {#what-stayed-the-same}\\n\\nDi\u011fer her \u015fey. Ciddiyiz.\\n\\n- **T\xfcm API\'ler ayn\u0131 kald\u0131** - `Enforce()`, `AddPolicy()`, `GetAllRoles()` ve di\u011fer t\xfcm y\xf6ntemler eskiden oldu\u011fu gibi \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor\\n- **Model ve politika s\xf6zdizimi de\u011fi\u015fmedi** - Mevcut `.conf` model dosyalar\u0131n\u0131z ve `.csv` politika dosyalar\u0131n\u0131z de\u011fi\u015fikli\u011fe u\u011framadan \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor\\n- **Adapter aray\xfcz\xfc de\u011fi\u015fmedi** - `persist.Adapter` y\xf6ntemleri ayn\u0131; adapterlerin yaln\u0131zca v3 mod\xfcl yoluna kar\u015f\u0131 derlenmi\u015f bir s\xfcr\xfcme ihtiyac\u0131 var\\n- **Performans karakteristikleri** - Performans gerilemesi veya iyile\u015fmesi yok; ayn\u0131 motor\\n- **Ara katman entegrasyonlar\u0131** - Ara katmanlar, uygulaman\u0131z\u0131n enforcer\'\u0131 ile ayn\u0131 ana s\xfcr\xfcm\xfc i\xe7e aktard\u0131ktan sonra ayn\u0131 \u015fekilde \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r\\n\\n## v3\'teki Yeni \xd6zellikler {#new-features-in-v3}\\n\\nAral\u0131k 2025\'teki v3.0.0 s\xfcr\xfcm\xfcnden bu yana, birka\xe7 yeni \xf6zellik eklendi:\\n\\n### v3.7.0+: Geli\u015ftirilmi\u015f G\xfcnl\xfck Entegrasyonu {#v370-enhanced-logger-integration}\\nArt\u0131k \xf6zel g\xfcnl\xfckleri (loggers) Casbin\'in temel uygulama ve politika y\xf6netim i\u015flemlerine entegre edebilir, b\xf6ylece daha iyi g\xf6zlemlenebilirlik sa\u011flayabilirsiniz:\\n\\n```go\\nenforcer.SetLogger(yourCustomLogger)\\n```\\n\\n### v3.8.0+: GetAllUsers() API\'si {#v380-getallusers-api}\\nKullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 rollerden ay\u0131rt etmek i\xe7in yeni bir API:\\n\\n```go\\nusers, err := enforcer.GetAllUsers()\\n```\\n\\nGer\xe7ek kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 rol tan\u0131mlar\u0131ndan ayr\u0131 olarak listelemeniz gerekti\u011finde RBAC sistemlerinde \xf6zellikle faydal\u0131d\u0131r.\\n\\n### v3.9.0+: Dahili D\xf6ng\xfc Tespiti {#v390-built-in-cycle-detection}\\nEnforcer art\u0131k rol hiyerar\u015filerindeki d\xf6ng\xfclerin otomatik tespitini i\xe7eriyor ve sonsuz d\xf6ng\xfcleri engelliyor:\\n\\n```go\\n// Automatically detects and prevents circular role assignments\\nenforcer.AddGroupingPolicy(\\"alice\\", \\"admin\\")\\nenforcer.AddGroupingPolicy(\\"admin\\", \\"alice\\") // Will be detected as a cycle\\n```\\n\\n### v3.10.0+: Yapay Zeka Destekli Yetkilendirme \u0130\xe7g\xf6r\xfcs\xfc i\xe7in Explain() API\'si {#v3100-explain-api-for-ai-powered-authorization-insights}\\nEn son \xf6zellik, yetkilendirme kararlar\u0131n\u0131 do\u011fal dilde a\xe7\u0131klamak i\xe7in LLM API\'lerinden yararlan\u0131yor:\\n\\n```go\\nenforcer.SetAIConfig(casbin.AIConfig{\\n    Endpoint: \\"https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions\\",\\n    APIKey:   os.Getenv(\\"OPENAI_API_KEY\\"),\\n    Model:    \\"gpt-4\\",\\n})\\n\\nexplanation, err := enforcer.Explain(\\"alice\\", \\"data1\\", \\"read\\")\\n// e.g. \\"Alice can read data1 because she has the \'reader\' role...\\"\\n```\\n\\nBu, karma\u015f\u0131k politikalar\u0131 hata ay\u0131klamak ve teknik olmayan payda\u015flar\u0131n yetkilendirme kararlar\u0131n\u0131 anlamas\u0131na yard\u0131mc\u0131 olmak i\xe7in \xf6zellikle de\u011ferlidir.\\n\\n## **Ge\xe7i\u015f Stratejisi** {#migration-strategy}\\n\\n### **Yeni Projeler \u0130\xe7in** {#for-new-projects}\\n\\nBasit: ba\u015ftan itibaren v3 kullan\u0131n.\\n\\n```bash\\ngo get github.com/casbin/casbin/v3\\n```\\n\\n```go\\nimport \\"github.com/casbin/casbin/v3\\"\\n```\\n\\n### **Mevcut v2 Projeleri \u0130\xe7in** {#for-existing-v2-projects}\\n\\nGe\xe7i\u015f i\u015flemi \xfc\xe7 ad\u0131mdan olu\u015fur:\\n\\n#### **Ad\u0131m 1: go.mod Dosyan\u0131z\u0131 G\xfcncelleyin** {#step-1-update-your-gomod}\\n\\n```bash\\ngo get github.com/casbin/casbin/v3\\ngo mod tidy\\n```\\n\\n#### **Ad\u0131m 2: \u0130\xe7e Aktarma (Import) \u0130fadelerini G\xfcncelleyin** {#step-2-update-import-statements}\\n\\nKod taban\u0131n\u0131zdaki t\xfcm Casbin i\xe7e aktarmalar\u0131n\u0131 bulun ve de\u011fi\u015ftirin:\\n\\n```bash\\n# Using sed on Unix/Linux/Mac\\nfind . -type f -name \'*.go\' -exec sed -i \'s|github.com/casbin/casbin/v2|github.com/casbin/casbin/v3|g\' {} +\\n\\n# Or manually in your editor\\n# Find: github.com/casbin/casbin/v2\\n# Replace: github.com/casbin/casbin/v3\\n```\\n\\n#### **Ad\u0131m 3: Adapt\xf6r \u0130\xe7e Aktarmalar\u0131n\u0131 G\xfcncelleyin (Varsa)** {#step-3-update-adapter-imports-if-applicable}\\n\\nBir adapt\xf6r, `casbin/v2` ve `casbin/v3` i\xe7indeki `model.Model` farkl\u0131 Go t\xfcrleri oldu\u011fu i\xe7in yaln\u0131zca belirli bir ana s\xfcr\xfcmdeki `persist.Adapter` aray\xfcz\xfcn\xfc uygular. Bu nedenle, v3 enforcer\'\u0131 `github.com/casbin/casbin/v3` paketini i\xe7e aktaran bir adapt\xf6r s\xfcr\xfcm\xfcne ihtiya\xe7 duyar. Adapt\xf6r\xfcn `go.mod` dosyas\u0131n\u0131 kontrol edin:\\n\\n```go\\n// Example: the PostgreSQL adapter already depends on casbin/v3\\nimport pgadapter \\"github.com/apache/casbin-pg-adapter\\"\\n\\n// The file adapter is built in and ships with each major version\\n```\\n\\nE\u011fer adapt\xf6r\xfcn\xfcz hen\xfcz g\xfcncellenmediyse, g\xfcncellenene kadar o servis i\xe7in v2\'de kal\u0131n veya adapt\xf6r deposunda bir issue a\xe7\u0131n.\\n\\n### **Geri Alma Plan\u0131** {#rollback-plan}\\n\\nGeri alman\u0131z gerekiyorsa:\\n\\n1. **Kod seviyesi**: \u0130\xe7e aktarma de\u011fi\u015fikliklerini geri al\u0131n (s\xfcr\xfcm kontrol\xfc kullanarak)\\n2. **Ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131k seviyesi**: `go get github.com/casbin/casbin/v2@latest`\\n3. **Da\u011f\u0131t\u0131m**: Geri almak i\xe7in standart da\u011f\u0131t\u0131m s\xfcrecinizi kullan\u0131n\\n\\nBu ge\xe7i\u015fin g\xfczelli\u011fi, geri alman\u0131n \xe7ok basit olmas\u0131d\u0131r - sadece i\xe7e aktarma de\u011fi\u015fikliklerini geri al\u0131n ve yeniden da\u011f\u0131t\u0131n.\\n\\n## **Politika Veritaban\u0131m\u0131 Ge\xe7irmem Gerekiyor mu?** {#do-i-need-to-migrate-my-policy-database}\\n\\n**Hay\u0131r.** Mevcut politika verileriniz de\u011fi\u015fmeden kal\u0131r. Politikalar basit dizeler olarak (subject, object, action vb.) saklan\u0131r ve Casbin s\xfcr\xfcm\xfcne ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131 de\u011fildirler.\\n\\n## **Ge\xe7i\u015f \u0130\u015fleminizi Test Etme** {#testing-your-migration}\\n\\n### **Otomatik Testler** {#automated-testing}\\n\\nMevcut testleriniz herhangi bir de\u011fi\u015fiklik yap\u0131lmadan ge\xe7melidir:\\n\\n```go\\nfunc TestPolicyEnforcement(t *testing.T) {\\n    // This test works identically in v2 and v3\\n    e, _ := casbin.NewEnforcer(\\"model.conf\\", \\"policy.csv\\")\\n    \\n    ok, _ := e.Enforce(\\"alice\\", \\"data1\\", \\"read\\")\\n    if !ok {\\n        t.Error(\\"Expected alice to have read access to data1\\")\\n    }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### **Entegrasyon Testleri** {#integration-testing}\\n\\n`*casbin.Enforcer` alan ara yaz\u0131l\u0131m (middleware), adapt\xf6rlerle ayn\u0131 \u015fekilde tek bir ana s\xfcr\xfcme ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r. E\u011fer ara yaz\u0131l\u0131m\u0131n\u0131z h\xe2l\xe2 `casbin/v2` kullan\u0131yorsa, enforcer\'\u0131 do\u011frudan \xe7a\u011f\u0131rmak birka\xe7 sat\u0131r kod gerektirir:\\n\\n```go\\n// Example with Gin\\nimport (\\n    \\"net/http\\"\\n\\n    \\"github.com/casbin/casbin/v3\\"\\n    \\"github.com/gin-gonic/gin\\"\\n)\\n\\nfunc Authorizer(e *casbin.Enforcer) gin.HandlerFunc {\\n    return func(c *gin.Context) {\\n        ok, err := e.Enforce(c.GetString(\\"user\\"), c.Request.URL.Path, c.Request.Method)\\n        if err != nil || !ok {\\n            c.AbortWithStatus(http.StatusForbidden)\\n            return\\n        }\\n        c.Next()\\n    }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### **Y\xfck Testleri** {#load-testing}\\n\\nStandart y\xfck testlerinizi v3 derlemesi \xfczerinde \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n. Performans karakteristikleri v2 ile ayn\u0131 olmal\u0131d\u0131r.\\n\\n### **Politika Do\u011frulama** {#policy-verification}\\n\\nS\xfcr\xfcmler aras\u0131ndaki politika de\u011ferlendirmesini kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n:\\n\\n```bash\\n# Export policies from v2\\n# Load into v3\\n# Run test cases against both\\n# Compare results\\n```\\n\\nHerhangi bir fark g\xf6r\xfcrseniz, bu muhtemelen bir hatad\u0131r - l\xfctfen bildirin!\\n\\n## **Yayg\u0131n Tuzaklar** {#common-pitfalls}\\n\\n### **Tuzak 1: Kar\u0131\u015f\u0131k v2/v3 Ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131** {#pitfall-1-mixed-v2v3-dependencies}\\n\\n**Sorun**: Baz\u0131 ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131klar Casbin v2 kullan\u0131yor, di\u011ferleri v3 kullan\u0131yor ve bu da \xe7ak\u0131\u015fmalara neden oluyor.\\n\\n**\xc7\xf6z\xfcm**: Derlemenin kendisi sorun de\u011fil: Go mod\xfcl sistemi v2 ve v3\'\xfc ayr\u0131 paketler olarak ele al\u0131r, bu nedenle her ikisi de ayn\u0131 ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131k a\u011fac\u0131nda bulunabilir. Yapamayaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131z \u015fey, v2 bekleyen bir k\xfct\xfcphaneye v3 enforcer\'\u0131 ge\xe7mektir. Enforcer\'\u0131, adapt\xf6r\xfcn\xfc ve ara yaz\u0131l\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 ayn\u0131 ana s\xfcr\xfcmde tutun.\\n\\n### **Tuzak 2: Adapt\xf6r S\xfcr\xfcm Uyumsuzlu\u011fu** {#pitfall-2-adapter-version-mismatch}\\n\\n**Sorun**: Casbin v3 ile v2 adapt\xf6r\xfc kullanmak (veya tam tersi).\\n\\n**\xc7\xf6z\xfcm**: Bu durum \xe7al\u0131\u015fma zaman\u0131nda de\u011fil, derleme hatas\u0131 olarak ortaya \xe7\u0131kar. Adapt\xf6r\xfcn `go.mod` dosyas\u0131n\u0131n hangi Casbin ana s\xfcr\xfcm\xfcn\xfc gerektirdi\u011fini kontrol edin ve enforcer\'\u0131n\u0131zla e\u015fle\u015fen bir s\xfcr\xfcm kullan\u0131n.\\n\\n### **Tuzak 3: Dahili Paketleri Unutmak** {#pitfall-3-forgetting-internal-packages}\\n\\n**Sorun**: Ana uygulama i\xe7e aktarmalar\u0131 g\xfcncellendi ancak dahili paketler veya ara\xe7lar unutuldu.\\n\\n**\xc7\xf6z\xfcm**: T\xfcm Casbin ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 bulmak i\xe7in `go mod graph` ve `go mod why` komutlar\u0131n\u0131 kullan\u0131n:\\n\\n```bash\\ngo mod graph | grep casbin\\n```\\n\\n### **Tuzak 4: \xd6zel Adapt\xf6r Derleme Sorunlar\u0131** {#pitfall-4-custom-adapter-compilation-issues}\\n\\n**Problem**: \xd6zel adapt\xf6r y\xfckseltme sonras\u0131 derlenmiyor.\\n\\n**Solution**: Adapt\xf6r aray\xfcz\xfc de\u011fi\u015fmedi, bu nedenle bir import sorunu oldu\u011funu d\xfc\u015f\xfcnd\xfcr\xfcyor. Adapt\xf6r\xfcn\xfczdeki t\xfcm Casbin importlar\u0131n\u0131n v3 kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol edin:\\n\\n```go\\nimport (\\n    \\"github.com/casbin/casbin/v3\\"\\n    \\"github.com/casbin/casbin/v3/persist\\"\\n)\\n```\\n\\n## S\u0131k\xe7a Sorulan Sorular {#faq}\\n\\n### S: v2 h\xe2l\xe2 bak\u0131m\u0131 yap\u0131l\u0131yor mu? {#q-is-v2-still-maintained}\\n\\nBu yaz\u0131 itibar\u0131yla, v2 kritik hata d\xfczeltmeleri al\u0131yor, ancak yeni \xf6zellikler v3 i\xe7in geli\u015ftiriliyor. \xd6n\xfcm\xfczdeki 6-12 ay i\xe7inde ge\xe7i\u015f yapmay\u0131 planlay\u0131n.\\n\\n### S: Baz\u0131 servisleri v2\'de, di\u011ferlerini v3\'te tutarak kademeli olarak ge\xe7i\u015f yapabilir miyim? {#q-can-i-gradually-migrate-by-having-some-services-on-v2-and-others-on-v3}\\n\\nEvet! Hatta ayn\u0131 politika veritaban\u0131n\u0131 payla\u015fabilirler. Bu, v3\'teki minimal de\u011fi\u015fikliklerin avantajlar\u0131ndan biridir.\\n\\n### S: Middleware\'im (Gin, Echo, Fiber vb.) \xe7al\u0131\u015facak m\u0131? {#q-will-my-middleware-gin-echo-fiber-etc-work}\\n\\nYaln\u0131zca enforcer\'\u0131n\u0131zla ayn\u0131 ana s\xfcr\xfcm\xfc import ediyorsa \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. Middleware\'in `go.mod` dosyas\u0131n\u0131 kontrol edin; h\xe2l\xe2 v2\'deyse, yukar\u0131da g\xf6sterildi\u011fi gibi kendi k\xfc\xe7\xfck bir handler\'\u0131n\u0131zdan `Enforce()` fonksiyonunu \xe7a\u011f\u0131r\u0131n.\\n\\n### S: .conf model dosyalar\u0131m\u0131 g\xfcncellemem gerekiyor mu? {#q-do-i-need-to-update-my-conf-model-files}\\n\\nHay\u0131r. Model dosyas\u0131 s\xf6zdizimi de\u011fi\u015fmedi.\\n\\n### S: .csv politika dosyalar\u0131m\u0131 g\xfcncellemem gerekiyor mu? {#q-do-i-need-to-update-my-csv-policy-files}\\n\\nHay\u0131r. Politika dosyas\u0131 format\u0131 de\u011fi\u015fmedi.\\n\\n### S: WatcherEx, FilteredAdapter ve di\u011fer aray\xfczler ne olacak? {#q-what-about-watcherex-filteredadapter-and-other-interfaces}\\n\\nT\xfcm aray\xfczler de\u011fi\u015fmeden kald\u0131. Kodunuz bu aray\xfczleri uyguluyorsa, hi\xe7bir de\u011fi\u015fiklik yapman\u0131za gerek yok (import yollar\u0131 hari\xe7).\\n\\n### S: Performans etkisi var m\u0131? {#q-performance-impact}\\n\\nYok. v3, v2 ile ayn\u0131 de\u011ferlendirme motorunu kullan\u0131yor.\\n\\n### S: v3\'\xfc Go 1.16 ile kullanabilir miyim? {#q-can-i-use-v3-with-go-116}\\n\\nCasbin v3 deposundaki go.mod dosyas\u0131nda desteklenen minimum Go s\xfcr\xfcm\xfcn\xfc kontrol edin. Genel olarak, en kararl\u0131 Go s\xfcr\xfcm\xfcn\xfcn kullan\u0131lmas\u0131 \xf6nerilir.\\n\\nKeyifli y\xfckseltmeler!"},{"id":"casbin-2025-ai-agent-era","metadata":{"permalink":"/tr/blog/casbin-2025-ai-agent-era","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2025-12-11-casbin-2025-ai-agent-era.md","source":"@site/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2025-12-11-casbin-2025-ai-agent-era.md","title":"2025\'te Casbin: Yapay Zeka Ajan \xc7a\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in Yetkilendirme","description":"2024, yapay zeka ajanlar\u0131n\u0131n demo a\u015famas\u0131ndan \xfcretim ortam\u0131na ge\xe7ti\u011fi y\u0131l oldu. Model Context Protocol (MCP), Google, OpenAI, Microsoft ve di\u011fer bir\xe7ok kurulu\u015f taraf\u0131ndan benimsendi ve uygulamalar\u0131n harici hizmetlerle ileti\u015fim kurma \u015fekli de\u011fi\u015fiyor. Bu d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcm, Casbin olarak \xfczerinde \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z yeni bir yetkilendirme zorluklar\u0131 k\xfcmesini de beraberinde getiriyor.","date":"2025-12-11T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"casbin","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/casbin"},{"inline":true,"label":"roadmap","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/roadmap"},{"inline":true,"label":"AI","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/ai"},{"inline":true,"label":"MCP","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/mcp"},{"inline":true,"label":"edge-computing","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/edge-computing"},{"inline":true,"label":"LLM","permalink":"/tr/blog/tags/llm"}],"readingTime":3.75,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Yang Luo","title":"Creator of Casbin","url":"https://github.com/hsluoyz","imageURL":"/tr/img/authors/hsluoyz.png","key":"hsluoyz","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"2025\'te Casbin: Yapay Zeka Ajan \xc7a\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in Yetkilendirme","slug":"casbin-2025-ai-agent-era","authors":["hsluoyz"],"tags":["casbin","roadmap","AI","MCP","edge-computing","LLM"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Casbin\'i (Go) v2\'den v3\'e Y\xfckseltme: Tam Kapsaml\u0131 Ge\xe7i\u015f Rehberi","permalink":"/tr/blog/upgrading-casbin-go-v2-to-v3"},"nextItem":{"title":"Casbin E\u015fle\u015ftirmesinin Nas\u0131l \xc7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 Ayr\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 Anlama","permalink":"/tr/blog/2023/12/08/understanding-casbin-matching-in-detail"}},"content":"2024, yapay zeka ajanlar\u0131n\u0131n demo a\u015famas\u0131ndan \xfcretim ortam\u0131na ge\xe7ti\u011fi y\u0131l oldu. Model Context Protocol (MCP), Google, OpenAI, Microsoft ve di\u011fer bir\xe7ok kurulu\u015f taraf\u0131ndan benimsendi ve uygulamalar\u0131n harici hizmetlerle ileti\u015fim kurma \u015fekli de\u011fi\u015fiyor. Bu d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcm, Casbin olarak \xfczerinde \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z yeni bir yetkilendirme zorluklar\u0131 k\xfcmesini de beraberinde getiriyor.\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\n## D\xfcnya De\u011fi\u015fti {#the-world-has-changed}\\n\\n2017\'de Casbin\'e ba\u015flad\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131zda tipik bir yetkilendirme senaryosu olduk\xe7a basitti: Bir kullan\u0131c\u0131 istek g\xf6nderir, izinlerinin olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol ederiz ve i\u015flem tamamlan\u0131r. Peki ya bug\xfcn? Bir yapay zeka ajan\u0131, bir kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n ad\u0131na hareket ediyor olabilir, her biri kendi ara\xe7 izinlerine sahip birden fazla MCP sunucusunu \xe7a\u011f\u0131r\u0131yor olabilir ve t\xfcm bu s\xfcre\xe7 milisaniyeler i\xe7inde u\xe7 noktada (edge) ger\xe7ekle\u015fmelidir.\\n\\nMCP spesifikasyonu art\u0131k MCP sunucular\u0131n\u0131 OAuth 2.0 Kaynak Sunucular\u0131 olarak s\u0131n\u0131fland\u0131r\u0131yor (Haziran 2025 g\xfcncellemesi) ve `mcp:tools:weather` veya `mcp:resources:customer-data:read` gibi ince taneli kapsamlar (scopes) i\xe7eriyor. Casbin tam da bu t\xfcr gran\xfcler yetki modelleri i\xe7in tasarlanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131; ancak MCP ve OAuth entegrasyonunun daha fazla \xe7al\u0131\u015fmaya ihtiyac\u0131 var.\\n\\n## \xdczerinde \xc7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131klar\u0131m\u0131z {#what-were-working-on}\\n\\n### MCP Sunucu Yetkilendirmesi {#mcp-server-authorization}\\n\\nBu, ana odak alanlar\u0131m\u0131zdan biri. Bir yapay zeka ajan\u0131 bir MCP sunucusunu \xe7a\u011f\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131nda, sunucu \u015funa karar vermelidir: Bu ajan, bu kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n ad\u0131na bu arac\u0131 bu parametrelerle \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilir mi?\\n\\nGeleneksel RBAC yeterli de\u011fildir. ABAC gibi bir \u015feye ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z var\u2014\xf6rne\u011fin \u201cbu ajan, mesai saatleri boyunca Alice\'in b\xf6lgesindeki m\xfc\u015fteri verilerine eri\u015febilir mi?\u201d Casbin\'in ilke modelinin bu k\u0131s\u0131tlamalar\u0131 nas\u0131l ifade edebilece\u011fini ara\u015ft\u0131r\u0131yoruz.\\n\\nZorluk \u015fu ki: MCP sunucular\u0131 \xe7ok h\u0131zl\u0131 karar vermeli. Ayr\u0131 bir yetkilendirme servisini \xe7a\u011f\u0131rmak yerine, MCP sunucu s\xfcreci i\xe7inde hafifletilmi\u015f ilke de\u011ferlendirmesine bak\u0131yoruz.\\n\\n### U\xe7 Nokta \xd6ncelikli Yetkilendirme {#edge-first-authorization}\\n\\nCloudflare Workers, Deno Deploy, Vercel Edge Functions - u\xe7 bili\u015fim (edge computing) alan\u0131 patlama ya\u015fad\u0131. 2025\'te 50ms alt\u0131 yan\u0131t s\xfcreleri standart hale geldi ve merkezi bir sunucuya yap\u0131lan yetkilendirme kontrol\xfc i\xe7in 100ms eklemeyi kar\u015f\u0131layamazs\u0131n\u0131z.\\n\\nBu durum bizi Casbin\'in \xe7al\u0131\u015fma \u015feklini farkl\u0131 d\xfc\u015f\xfcnmeye itiyor. \u0130lkeleri WebAssembly\'e derleyip do\u011frudan V8 izolasyonlar\u0131nda \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rabilir miyiz? Tutarl\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 korurken u\xe7 noktada ak\u0131ll\u0131 ilke \xf6nbellekleme yapabilir miyiz? Bunlar zor problemler ve hen\xfcz t\xfcm cevaplar\u0131na sahip de\u011filiz, ancak i\u015flerin gitti\u011fi y\xf6n bu.\\n\\n\xd6zellikle Cloudflare Workers ekosistemiyle ilgileniyoruz - yerle\u015fik OAuth deste\u011fiyle MCP sunucular\u0131 i\xe7in tam bir platform olu\u015fturdular. Oraya y\xf6nelik native bir Casbin entegrasyonu g\xfc\xe7l\xfc olabilir.\\n\\n### RAG Pipeline Yetkilendirmesi {#rag-pipeline-authorization}\\n\\nS\u0131k kar\u015f\u0131la\u015f\u0131lan bir tema: LLM\'in dahili belgelere eri\u015fmesi gereken RAG sistemleri kuran \u015firketler, ancak her kullan\u0131c\u0131 yaln\u0131zca g\xf6rmeye izni olan belgeleri g\xf6rebilmelidir.\\n\\nOWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications 2025 listesinde \u201cHassas Bil\u015fifalmas\u0131\u201d b\xfcy\xfck bir risk olarak belirtiliyor. \xc7\xf6z\xfcm sadece \xe7\u0131kt\u0131lar\u0131 filtrelemek de\u011fil, ayn\u0131 zamanda LLM\'in kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n eri\u015fim yetkisi olmayan belgeleri asla geri getirmemesini (retrieve etmemesini) sa\u011flamakt\u0131r.\\n\\nBu nedenle yetkilendirme, vekt\xf6r deposu sorgu seviyesinde ger\xe7ekle\u015fmelidir. Casbin ilkelerini vekt\xf6r DB\'leri i\xe7in meta veri filtrelerine d\xf6n\xfc\u015ft\xfcrmeyi inceliyoruz\u2014yani bir izin kontrol\xfc, geri getirme i\u015flemine itilen (push down) bir WHERE c\xfcmlesi haline gelir.\\n\\n### \xc7oklu Ajan Senaryolar\u0131 {#multi-agent-scenarios}\\n\\nBir zincirdeki birden fazla ajanla (\xf6rne\u011fin kodlama ajan\u0131 \u2192 da\u011f\u0131t\u0131m ajan\u0131 \u2192 izleme ajan\u0131), yetki devri (permission delegation) zordur. Her ajan\u0131n farkl\u0131 yetenekleri olabilir ve t\xfcm zinciri takip etmeniz gerekir.\\n\\nOAuth\'un On-Behalf-Of (OBO) ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 bunun bir k\u0131sm\u0131n\u0131 kapsar, ancak \u201cajan B, kullan\u0131c\u0131 alice ad\u0131na ajan A ad\u0131na X i\u015flemini yapabilir mi\u201d mant\u0131\u011f\u0131 net bir modele ihtiya\xe7 duyar. Casbin\'in rol hiyerar\u015fileri ve domain RBAC\'si ajan hiyerar\u015filerine geni\u015fletilebilir; semantikler \xfczerinde \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yoruz.\\n\\n## Geleneksel Yol Haritas\u0131 \u0130\u015fleri {#the-traditional-roadmap-stuff}\\n\\nElbette, temel konular\u0131 terk etmiyoruz. Listemizdeki baz\u0131 pratik \u015feyler:\\n\\n**Dil implementasyonlar\u0131n\u0131n yeti\u015fmesi** - SwiftCasbin ve Lua-Casbin, Go ve Node.js s\xfcr\xfcmlerine k\u0131yasla \xf6zelliklerde hala geride. `in` operat\xf6r\xfc, WatcherEx, `g` fonksiyonu i\xe7in daha iyi \xf6nbellekleme - bunlar\u0131n her yerde tutarl\u0131 olmas\u0131 gerekiyor.\\n\\n**Yeni framework ara katman yaz\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131 (middlewares)** - go-zero defalarca talep edildi. Rust i\xe7in Poem ilgi g\xf6r\xfcyor. Java i\xe7in Play Framework uzun s\xfcredir istek listesinde.\\n\\n**Performans \xe7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131** - Bu yeni kullan\u0131m senaryolar\u0131 i\xe7in ilkeler karma\u015f\u0131kla\u015ft\u0131k\xe7a, de\u011ferlendirme h\u0131z\u0131 daha \xf6nemli hale geliyor. T\xfcm implementasyonlarda daha iyi benchmarking, profil \xe7\u0131karma ve optimizasyona ihtiyac\u0131m\u0131z var.\\n\\n## Hen\xfcz bilmediklerimiz {#what-we-dont-know-yet}\\n\\nYapay zeka ajan yetkilendirme alan\u0131 h\u0131zla geli\u015fiyor; biz de s\xfcre\xe7te \xf6\u011freniyoruz. A\xe7\u0131k sorular:\\n\\n- Casbin\'in \\"ajan kimli\u011fi\\" ile \\"kullan\u0131c\u0131 kimli\u011fi\\" i\xe7in birinci s\u0131n\u0131f (first-class) primitifleri olmal\u0131 m\u0131?\\n- MCP arac\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131yla dinamik olarak ke\u015ffedilen ara\xe7lar i\xe7in yetkilendirmeyi nas\u0131l ele al\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z?\\n- Politikalar ger\xe7ek zamanl\u0131 ba\u011flama ba\u011fl\u0131 olabilecekken do\u011fru \xf6nbellekleme stratejisi nedir?\\n\\nBu alanda geli\u015ftirme yap\u0131yor ve yetkilendirme sorunlar\u0131yla kar\u015f\u0131la\u015f\u0131yorsan\u0131z, sizden haber almak isteriz. En iyi \xf6zellikler ger\xe7ek kullan\u0131m senaryolar\u0131ndan do\u011far.\\n\\n## **Getting involved** {#getting-involved}\\n\\nY\u0131llard\u0131r GSoC organizasyonuyuz ve bu yapay zeka ile ilgili konular yaz projeleri i\xe7in uygun. GSoC\'yi beklemenize gerek yok\u2014e\u011fer ilginizi \xe7ekiyorsa Discord \xfczerinden ula\u015f\u0131n veya GitHub\'da bir issue a\xe7\u0131n.\\n\\n\xd6n\xfcm\xfczdeki birka\xe7 y\u0131l yetkilendirme i\xe7in olduk\xe7a hareketli ge\xe7ecek. Sorunlar daha zor ama ayn\u0131 zamanda daha ilgi \xe7ekici. Bunlar\u0131 birlikte \xe7\xf6zmek i\xe7in heyecanl\u0131y\u0131z."},{"id":"/2023/12/08/understanding-casbin-matching-in-detail","metadata":{"permalink":"/tr/blog/2023/12/08/understanding-casbin-matching-in-detail","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2023-12-08-understanding-casbin-matching-in-detail.md","source":"@site/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2023-12-08-understanding-casbin-matching-in-detail.md","title":"Casbin E\u015fle\u015ftirmesinin Nas\u0131l \xc7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 Ayr\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 Anlama","description":"Bu makale, Casbin k\xfct\xfcphanesi ile RBAC\'nin nas\u0131l tasarlan\u0131p uygulanaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7\u0131klar. Kaynak hiyerar\u015filerine ve izinleri devralan rollere sahip SaaS platformlar\u0131 i\xe7in Casbin performansl\u0131 bir se\xe7enektir.","date":"2023-12-08T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":5.09,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Aravinda Kumar","url":"https://github.com/aravindarc","imageURL":"/tr/img/authors/aravindarc.png","key":"aravindarc","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Casbin E\u015fle\u015ftirmesinin Nas\u0131l \xc7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 Ayr\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 Anlama","authors":["aravindarc"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"2025\'te Casbin: Yapay Zeka Ajan \xc7a\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in Yetkilendirme","permalink":"/tr/blog/casbin-2025-ai-agent-era"},"nextItem":{"title":"APISIX\'te Casbin Kullanarak Yetkilendirme","permalink":"/tr/blog/2021/08/19/apisix-casbin-authorization"}},"content":"Bu makale, [Casbin](https://casbin.apache.org/) k\xfct\xfcphanesi ile RBAC\'nin nas\u0131l tasarlan\u0131p uygulanaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7\u0131klar. Kaynak hiyerar\u015filerine ve izinleri devralan rollere sahip SaaS platformlar\u0131 i\xe7in Casbin performansl\u0131 bir se\xe7enektir.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## RBAC\'ye Giri\u015f {#introduction-to-rbac}\\n\\nRBAC, eri\u015fimi kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n sahip oldu\u011fu rollere g\xf6re k\u0131s\u0131tlar. **Hiyerar\u015fik** RBAC\'nin nas\u0131l \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6rmek i\xe7in Azure\'un RBAC yap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 inceliyor ve ard\u0131ndan Casbin\'de benzer bir \u015fey uyguluyoruz.\\n\\n## **Azure**\'in hiyerar\u015fik **RBAC**\'\u0131 {#azures-hierarchical-rbac}\\n\\n![Azure Hierarchy](/img/blog/azure-scope-levels.png)\\n\\n**Azure**\'de, **Owner** rol\xfc farkl\u0131 kapsamlarda uygulan\u0131r. Abonelik d\xfczeyinde **Owner** isem, o aboneli\u011fin alt\u0131ndaki t\xfcm kaynak gruplar\u0131n\u0131n ve kaynaklar\u0131n sahibiyimdir. Bir kaynak grubu d\xfczeyinde Owner isem, o gruptaki t\xfcm kaynaklar\u0131n sahibiyimdir.\\n\\nA\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki g\xf6rsel, abonelik d\xfczeyindeki Owner eri\u015fimini g\xf6stermektedir. ![Subscription Owner](/img/tutorial/subscription-owner.png)\\n\\nBu aboneli\u011fin alt\u0131ndaki bir kaynak grubu i\xe7in **IAM** kontrol edildi\u011finde, devral\u0131nan Owner eri\u015fimi g\xf6r\xfclmektedir. ![RG Owner](/img/tutorial/rg-owner.png)\\n\\n**Azure**\'\xfcn **RBAC**\'\u0131n\u0131n hiyerar\u015fik yap\u0131s\u0131 budur. Bir\xe7ok sistem benzer hiyerar\u015filer kullan\u0131r. Bu e\u011fitimde, Casbin ile kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131labilir bir model olu\u015fturuyoruz.\\n\\n## Casbin nas\u0131l \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r? {#how-casbin-works}\\n\\nCasbin\'in temel bile\u015fenlerini (request, policy, matcher, effect) anlamak, **RBAC** modelinizi tasarlamay\u0131 ve ayarlamay\u0131 kolayla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.\\n\\n## **ACL** nedir? {#what-is-acl}\\n\\n**ACL (Access Control List)**, kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 eylemlerle, eylemleri ise kaynaklarla e\u015fle\u015ftirir.\\n\\n### Model tan\u0131m\u0131 {#model-definition}\\n\\nMinimal bir **ACL** modeli:\\n\\n```toml\\n[request_definition]\\nr = sub, act, obj\\n\\n[policy_definition]\\np = sub, act, obj\\n\\n[policy_effect]\\ne = some(where (p.eft == allow))\\n\\n[matchers]\\nm = r.sub == p.sub && r.obj == p.obj && r.act == p.act\\n```\\n\\n1. **request_definition** \u2014 \u0130stek format\u0131n\u0131 tan\u0131mlar. \xd6rne\u011fin `alice, write, data1`, \\"Alice data1\'i yazabilir mi?\\" anlam\u0131na gelir.\\n2. **policy_definition** \u2014 Politika format\u0131n\u0131 tan\u0131mlar. \xd6rne\u011fin `alice, write, data1` politikas\u0131, Alice\'e data1\'i yazma izni verir.\\n3. **policy_effect** \u2014 Birden fazla e\u015fle\u015fen politikan\u0131n nas\u0131l birle\u015ftirildi\u011fini belirler (\xf6rne\u011fin allow-override).\\n4. **matchers** \u2014 Sa\u011flanmas\u0131 gereken ko\u015ful: `r.sub == p.sub && r.obj == p.obj && r.act == p.act`.\\n\\n### Casbin edit\xf6r\xfcnde deneyin {#try-it-in-the-casbin-editor}\\n\\n[Casbin edit\xf6r\xfcn\xfc](https://casbin.org/editor) a\xe7\u0131n ve yukar\u0131daki modeli **Model** edit\xf6r\xfcne yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.\\n\\nA\u015fa\u011f\u0131dakileri **Policy** edit\xf6r\xfcne yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n:\\n\\n```csv\\np, alice, read, data1\\np, bob, write, data2\\n```\\n\\nve a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dakileri **Request** edit\xf6r\xfcne yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n:\\n\\n```csv\\nalice, read, data1\\n```\\n\\nSonu\xe7 \u015fu olacakt\u0131r:\\n\\n```text\\ntrue\\n```\\n\\n### **ACL** modelinin, politikan\u0131n ve istek e\u015fle\u015fmesinin g\xf6rsel temsili {#visual-representation-of-the-acl-model-policy-and-request-matching}\\n\\n![acl](/img/tutorial/acl.png)\\n\\n## **RBAC** nedir? {#what-is-rbac}\\n\\n**RBAC (Role-Based Access Control)**, kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 rollere atar; rollerin kaynaklar \xfczerinde izinleri vard\u0131r. Bir istek, kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n rol\xfcn\xfcn kaynak \xfczerindeki eyleme izin verip vermedi\u011fini kontrol eder.\\n\\n### Model tan\u0131m\u0131 {#model-definition-1}\\n\\nBasit bir **RBAC** modeli:\\n\\n```toml\\n[request_definition]\\nr = sub, act, obj\\n\\n[policy_definition]\\np = sub, act, obj\\n\\n[role_definition]\\ng = _, _\\ng2 = _, _\\n\\n[policy_effect]\\ne = some(where (p.eft == allow))\\n\\n[matchers]\\nm = r.sub == p.sub && g(p.act, r.act) && r.obj == p.obj\\n```\\n\\n1. **role_definition** \u2014 Grafik ili\u015fkilerini tan\u0131mlar (\xf6rne\u011fin rol-rol veya kullan\u0131c\u0131-rol i\xe7in `g`). Matcher, rolleri ve izinleri \xe7\xf6zmek i\xe7in bunlar\u0131 kullan\u0131r.\\n\\n### Casbin edit\xf6r\xfcnde deneyin {#try-it-in-the-casbin-editor-1}\\n\\n[Edit\xf6r\xfc](https://casbin.org/editor) a\xe7\u0131n ve yukar\u0131daki modeli yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.\\n\\nA\u015fa\u011f\u0131dakileri **Policy** edit\xf6r\xfcne yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n:\\n\\n```csv\\np, alice, reader, data1\\np, bob, owner, data2\\n\\ng, reader, read\\ng, owner, read\\ng, owner, write\\n```\\n\\nve a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dakileri **Request** edit\xf6r\xfcne yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n:\\n\\n```csv\\nalice, read, data1\\nalice, write, data1\\nbob, write, data2\\nbob, read, data2\\nbob, write, data1\\n```\\n\\nSonu\xe7 \u015fu olacakt\u0131r:\\n\\n```text\\ntrue\\nfalse\\ntrue\\ntrue\\nfalse\\n```\\n\\n### **RBAC** modelinin, politikan\u0131n ve istek e\u015fle\u015fmesinin g\xf6rsel temsili {#visual-representation-of-the-rbac-model-policy-and-request-matching}\\n\\n![rbac](/img/tutorial/rbac.png)\\n\\n**g** (rolden-eyleme) ili\u015fkisi bir grafiktir. Politikada kenarlar olarak yaz\u0131l\u0131r, \xf6rne\u011fin:\\n\\n```csv\\ng, reader, read\\ng, owner, read\\ng, owner, write\\n```\\n\\n:::info\\n**p** normal bir politikad\u0131r (`==` ile kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r). **g** bir grafik ili\u015fkisidir. Son eklerle daha fazlas\u0131n\u0131 ekleyebilirsiniz: **g2**, **g3**, vb.\\n:::\\n\\n## Hiyerar\u015fik RBAC {#hierarchical-rbac}\\n\\nHiyerar\u015fik **RBAC**\'ta, kal\u0131t\u0131m i\xe7eren birden fazla **kaynak t\xfcr\xfc** vard\u0131r (\xf6rne\u011fin Subscription \u2192 ResourceGroup). Bir **sub1** aboneli\u011fi, **rg1** ve **rg2** kaynak gruplar\u0131n\u0131 i\xe7erebilir. Benzer \u015fekilde, aralar\u0131nda kal\u0131t\u0131m bulunan abonelik d\xfczeyinde roller/eylemler ve kaynak grubu d\xfczeyinde roller/eylemler vard\u0131r. \xd6rne\u011fin, abonelik rol\xfc **sub-owner**, kaynak grubu rol\xfc **rg-owner**\'a devredilebilir: E\u011fer **sub1** \xfczerinde **sub-owner** isem, fiilen **rg1** ve **rg2** \xfczerinde **rg-owner** olurum.\\n\\n### Model tan\u0131m\u0131 {#model-definition-2}\\n\\nMinimal bir hiyerar\u015fik **RBAC** modeli:\\n\\n```toml\\n[request_definition]\\nr = sub, act, obj\\n\\n[policy_definition]\\np = sub, act, obj\\n\\n[role_definition]\\ng = _, _\\ng2 = _, _\\n\\n[policy_effect]\\ne = some(where (p.eft == allow))\\n\\n[matchers]\\nm = r.sub == p.sub && g(p.act, r.act) && g2(p.obj, r.obj)\\n```\\n\\nBurada **g** rolleri/eylemleri ba\u011flarken, **g2** kaynaklar\u0131 ba\u011flar (\xf6rne\u011fin aboneli\u011fi kaynak grubuna).\\n\\n### Casbin edit\xf6r\xfcnde deneyin {#try-it-in-the-casbin-editor-2}\\n\\n[D\xfczenleyici](https://casbin.org/editor) uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7\u0131n ve yukar\u0131daki modeli yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.\\n\\nA\u015fa\u011f\u0131dakileri **Policy** d\xfczenleyicisine yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n:\\n\\n```csv\\np, alice, sub-reader, sub1\\np, bob, rg-owner, rg2\\n\\n// subscription role to subscription action mapping\\ng, sub-reader, sub-read\\ng, sub-owner, sub-read\\ng, sub-owner, sub-write\\n\\n// resourceGroup role to resourceGroup action mapping\\ng, rg-reader, rg-read\\ng, rg-owner, rg-read\\ng, rg-owner, rg-write\\n\\n// subscription role to resourceGroup role mapping\\ng, sub-reader, rg-reader\\ng, sub-owner, rg-owner\\n\\n// subscription resource to resourceGroup resource mapping\\ng2, sub1, rg1\\ng2, sub2, rg2\\n```\\n\\nVe a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dakileri **Request** d\xfczenleyicisine yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n:\\n\\n```csv\\nalice, rg-read, rg1\\n```\\n\\nSonu\xe7 \u015fu olacakt\u0131r:\\n\\n```text\\ntrue\\n```\\n\\n### RBAC modelinin, ilkenin ve istek e\u015fle\u015fmesinin g\xf6rsel temsili {#visual-representation-of-the-rbac-model-policy-and-request-matching-1}\\n\\n![hrbac](/img/tutorial/hrbac.png)\\n\\n**g** kenarlar\u0131 (rol \u2192 eylem, rol \u2192 rol) ilkede \u015fu \u015fekilde yaz\u0131labilir:\\n\\n```csv\\n// subscription role to subscription action mapping\\ng, sub-reader, sub-read\\ng, sub-owner, sub-read\\ng, sub-owner, sub-write\\n\\n// resourceGroup role to resourceGroup action mapping\\ng, rg-reader, rg-read\\ng, rg-owner, rg-read\\ng, rg-owner, rg-write\\n\\n// subscription role to resourceGroup role mapping\\ng, sub-reader, rg-reader\\ng, sub-owner, rg-owner\\n```\\n\\n**g2** kenarlar\u0131 aboneli\u011fi kaynak grubuna e\u015fler:\\n\\n```csv\\n// subscription resource to resourceGroup resource mapping\\ng2, sub1, rg1\\ng2, sub2, rg2\\n```\\n\\n#### \xd6zne E\u015fle\u015ftirme G\xf6rsel Temsili {#subject-matching-visual-representation}\\n\\n![hrbac-sub-match](/img/tutorial/hrbac-sub-match.png)\\n\\n#### Eylem E\u015fle\u015ftirme G\xf6rsel Temsili {#action-matching-visual-representation}\\n\\n![hrbac-act-match](/img/tutorial/hrbac-act-match.png)\\n\\n#### Nesne E\u015fle\u015ftirme G\xf6rsel Temsili {#object-matching-visual-representation}\\n\\n![hrbac-obj-match](/img/tutorial/hrbac-obj-match.png)\\n\\n:::info\\nCasbin iste\u011fi t\xfcm ilkelerle de\u011ferlendirir. En az bir ilke e\u015fle\u015firse sonu\xe7 **true**; aksi takdirde **false** olur.\\n:::\\n\\n## Sonu\xe7 {#conclusion}\\n\\nBu e\u011fitim, ACL, RBAC ve hiyerar\u015fik RBAC\'nin Casbin\'de nas\u0131l ifade edilebilece\u011fini g\xf6sterdi. Bir sonraki ad\u0131mda bunu bir Spring Boot uygulamas\u0131nda hayata ge\xe7irecek ve API\'leri Casbin ile g\xfcvence alt\u0131na alaca\u011f\u0131z."},{"id":"/2021/08/19/apisix-casbin-authorization","metadata":{"permalink":"/tr/blog/2021/08/19/apisix-casbin-authorization","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2021-08-19-apisix-casbin-authorization.md","source":"@site/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2021-08-19-apisix-casbin-authorization.md","title":"APISIX\'te Casbin Kullanarak Yetkilendirme","description":"Tekrarlanabilir izin verme, reddetme ve temizlik kontrolleriyle APISIX istek yolunda Casbin RBAC\'yi zorlay\u0131n ve g\xfcncelleyin.","date":"2021-08-19T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":4.64,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Rushikesh Tote","title":"Member of Casbin","url":"https://github.com/rushitote","imageURL":"/tr/img/authors/rushitote.png","key":"rushitote","page":null},{"name":"Yilia Lin","title":"Apache APISIX Committer","url":"https://github.com/Yilialinn","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114121331?v=4","key":"yilialin","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"APISIX\'te Casbin Kullanarak Yetkilendirme","description":"Tekrarlanabilir izin verme, reddetme ve temizlik kontrolleriyle APISIX istek yolunda Casbin RBAC\'yi zorlay\u0131n ve g\xfcncelleyin.","authors":["rushitote","yilialin"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Casbin E\u015fle\u015ftirmesinin Nas\u0131l \xc7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 Ayr\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 Anlama","permalink":"/tr/blog/2023/12/08/understanding-casbin-matching-in-detail"},"nextItem":{"title":"Yang Luo \u2014 Google Open Source Peer Bonus Kazanan\u0131","permalink":"/tr/blog/2020/04/21/google-award"}},"content":"## Giri\u015f {#introduction}\\n\\n[Apache APISIX](https://apisix.apache.org/), yerle\u015fik [`authz-casbin`](https://apisix.apache.org/docs/apisix/plugins/authz-casbin/) eklentisi ile a\u011f ge\xe7idinde Casbin yetkilendirme politikalar\u0131n\u0131\\nzorlayabilir.\\nEklenti, [Lua Casbin](https://github.com/apache/casbin-lua-casbin) kullan\u0131r ve ACL, RBAC ve ABAC gibi eri\u015fim kontrol modellerini destekler.\\n\\nBu rehber, APISIX istek yoluna k\xfc\xe7\xfck bir RBAC politikas\u0131 yerle\u015ftirir.\\n\u0130zin verilen ve reddedilen istekleri do\u011frulayacak, ard\u0131ndan rotay\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftirmeden eklenti meta verileri \xfczerinden payla\u015f\u0131lan bir politikay\u0131 g\xfcncelleyeceksiniz.\\n\\nEntegrasyonu ilk olarak Casbin toplulu\u011fu\\n[APISIX Issue #4674](https://github.com/apache/apisix/issues/4674) ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131nda \xf6nermi\u015f ve\\n[APISIX PR #4710](https://github.com/apache/apisix/pull/4710) eklentiyi eklemi\u015ftir.\\n\\n:::info A\u011fustos 2026 g\xfcncellemesi\\n\\nBu rehber A\u011fustos 2026\'da yenilendi.\\n\xd6rnekler Apache APISIX 3.17.0 ile do\u011fruland\u0131. Orijinal 2021 yazar\u0131n\u0131n atf\u0131 korunmakta olup, 2026 g\xfcncellemesi i\xe7in Yilia Lin eklenmi\u015ftir.\\n\\n:::\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n:::warning Kimlik do\u011frulama s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131\\n\\nCasbin kimlik do\u011frulama de\u011fil, yetkilendirme yapar.\\n\xd6rnek, testi k\xfc\xe7\xfck tutmak amac\u0131yla yaln\u0131zca `user` istek ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 \xf6zne olarak kullan\u0131r. \xdcretim ortam\u0131nda,\\ndo\u011frudan istemci taraf\u0131ndan sa\u011flanan bir kimlik ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131na g\xfcvenmeyin. Bir kimlik do\u011frulama katman\u0131 veya g\xfcvenilir proxy,\\nCasbin iste\u011fi de\u011ferlendirmeden \xf6nce kimli\u011fi belirlemeli ve g\xfcvenilir olmayan de\u011ferleri kald\u0131rmal\u0131 veya \xfczerine yazmal\u0131d\u0131r.\\n\\n:::\\n\\n## \xd6n ko\u015fullar ve ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 durumu {#prerequisites-and-starting-state}\\n\\nBu rehber, halihaz\u0131rda \xe7al\u0131\u015fan tek kullan\u0131ml\u0131k bir Apache APISIX 3.17.0 \xf6rne\u011fiyle ba\u015flar.\\nYerel bir \xf6rnek gerekiyorsa,\\n[APISIX Docker da\u011f\u0131t\u0131m rehberini](https://apisix.apache.org/docs/docker/manual/) izleyin ve\\nAPISIX imaj\u0131n\u0131 `apache/apisix:3.17.0-debian` olarak sabitleyin.\\n\\n\xd6rne\u011fin \u015funlara sahip olmas\u0131 gerekir:\\n\\n- `http://127.0.0.1:9080` adresinde kullan\u0131labilir veri d\xfczlemi (data plane);\\n- `http://127.0.0.1:9180` adresinde bulunan **Admin API**;\\n- Etkinle\u015ftirilmi\u015f yerle\u015fik `authz-casbin` ve `mocking` eklentileri.\\n\\nAyr\u0131ca `curl` ve `jq` ara\xe7lar\u0131na ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z var. `admin_key` de\u011ferini, **Admin API** i\xe7in yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131lan anahtar olarak ayarlay\u0131n:\\n\\n```sh\\nexport admin_key=\'<your-admin-api-key>\'\\n```\\n\\nDevam etmeden \xf6nce yer tutucuyu de\u011fi\u015ftirin. **Admin API**\'nin eri\u015filebilir oldu\u011funu ve eklentinin etkin oldu\u011funu do\u011frulay\u0131n:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl --fail-with-body \\\\\\n  \\"http://127.0.0.1:9180/apisix/admin/plugins/list\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\"X-API-KEY: $admin_key\\" | \\\\\\njq -e \'([\\"authz-casbin\\", \\"mocking\\"] - .) | length == 0\'\\n```\\n\\nKomutun `true` yazd\u0131rmas\u0131 gerekir. **Admin API**\'yi g\xfcvenilmeyen bir a\u011fa yay\u0131nlamay\u0131n veya g\xf6sterim ama\xe7l\u0131 kimlik bilgilerini ba\u015fka bir ortamda yeniden kullanmay\u0131n.\\n\\n## Modeli ve politikay\u0131 tan\u0131mlama {#define-the-model-and-policy}\\n\\nEklenti \xfc\xe7 istek de\u011ferini de\u011ferlendirir:\\n\\n- `sub`: Yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f istek ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan gelen \xf6zne;\\n- `obj`: \u0130stek URI yolu; ve\\n- `act`: HTTP y\xf6ntemi.\\n\\n`model.conf` dosyas\u0131n\u0131 olu\u015fturun:\\n\\n```ini\\n[request_definition]\\nr = sub, obj, act\\n\\n[policy_definition]\\np = sub, obj, act\\n\\n[role_definition]\\ng = _, _\\n\\n[policy_effect]\\ne = some(where (p.eft == allow))\\n\\n[matchers]\\nm = (g(r.sub, p.sub) || keyMatch(r.sub, p.sub)) && keyMatch(r.obj, p.obj) && keyMatch(r.act, p.act)\\n```\\n\\n`policy.csv` dosyas\u0131n\u0131 olu\u015fturun:\\n\\n```csv\\np, *, /anything, GET\\np, admin, *, *\\ng, alice, admin\\n```\\n\\nBu politika, herhangi bir \xf6znenin `GET /anything` g\xf6ndermesine izin verir. Ayr\u0131ca `alice` kullan\u0131c\u0131s\u0131na, her y\xf6ntemle her yola eri\u015febilen `admin` rol\xfcn\xfc atar.\\n\\n## Payla\u015f\u0131lan politikay\u0131 eklenti metadata\'s\u0131nda saklama {#store-the-shared-policy-in-plugin-metadata}\\n\\nDosyalar\u0131 JSON dizeleri olarak y\xfckleyin ve APISIX eklenti metadata\'s\u0131na yaz\u0131n:\\n\\n```sh\\njq -n \\\\\\n  --rawfile model model.conf \\\\\\n  --rawfile policy policy.csv \\\\\\n  \'{model: $model, policy: $policy}\' | \\\\\\ncurl --fail-with-body \\\\\\n  \\"http://127.0.0.1:9180/apisix/admin/plugin_metadata/authz-casbin\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\"X-API-KEY: $admin_key\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\"Content-Type: application/json\\" \\\\\\n  -X PUT \\\\\\n  --data-binary @-\\n```\\n\\nEklenti metadata\'s\u0131, kendi yol-yerel model ve politikas\u0131n\u0131 tan\u0131mlamadan `authz-casbin`\'i etkinle\u015ftiren rotalara tek bir model ve politika sa\u011flar.\\n\\n## Bir rotada yetkilendirmeyi etkinle\u015ftirme {#enable-authorization-on-a-route}\\n\\nBir rota olu\u015fturun ve eklentiye \xf6zneyi `user` ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan okumas\u0131n\u0131 s\xf6yleyin:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl --fail-with-body \\\\\\n  \\"http://127.0.0.1:9180/apisix/admin/routes/casbin-demo\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\"X-API-KEY: $admin_key\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\"Content-Type: application/json\\" \\\\\\n  -X PUT \\\\\\n  -d \'{\\n    \\"uri\\": \\"/*\\",\\n    \\"plugins\\": {\\n      \\"authz-casbin\\": {\\n        \\"username\\": \\"user\\"\\n      },\\n      \\"mocking\\": {\\n        \\"_meta\\": {\\n          \\"priority\\": 1000\\n        },\\n        \\"response_status\\": 200,\\n        \\"response_example\\": \\"{\\\\\\"message\\\\\\":\\\\\\"authorized\\\\\\"}\\"\\n      }\\n    },\\n    \\"upstream\\": {\\n      \\"type\\": \\"roundrobin\\",\\n      \\"nodes\\": {\\n        \\"127.0.0.1:1\\": 1\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\'\\n```\\n\\nRota yaln\u0131zca `username` alan\u0131n\u0131 yerel olarak tan\u0131mlad\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in, eklenti metadata\'s\u0131ndaki modeli ve politikay\u0131 kullan\u0131r. Yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda, rota-yerel bir model ve politika, eklenti metadata\'s\u0131ndan \xf6nceliklidir.\\n\\n`mocking` eklentisi, izin verilen isteklere deterministik bir yerel yan\u0131t verir, b\xf6ylece \xf6rnek genel bir upstream\'e ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131 olmaz. Yol-yerel \xf6nceli\u011fi `authz-casbin`\'den d\xfc\u015f\xfckt\xfcr, bu da yetkilendirme karar\u0131n\u0131n \xf6nce \xe7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar. Bu nedenle eri\u015filemeyen upstream ile ileti\u015fim kurulmaz. Bu \xf6ncelik ge\xe7ersiz k\u0131lma ve mock yan\u0131t test d\xfczenlemeleridir, \xfcretim \xf6nerileri de\u011fildir.\\n\\n## \u0130zin verme ve reddetme kararlar\u0131n\u0131 do\u011frulama {#verify-allow-and-deny-decisions}\\n\\nGenel yola anonim bir istek izin al\u0131r:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl -i http://127.0.0.1:9080/anything\\n```\\n\\nBeklenen durum kodu:\\n\\n```text\\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\\n{\\"message\\":\\"authorized\\"}\\n```\\n\\n`bob`, `admin` rol\xfcne sahip olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in farkl\u0131 bir yol reddedilir:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl -i http://127.0.0.1:9080/anything/res -H \'user: bob\'\\n```\\n\\nBeklenen sonu\xe7:\\n\\n```text\\nHTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden\\n{\\"message\\":\\"Access Denied\\"}\\n```\\n\\n`alice`, `admin` rol\xfcne sahip oldu\u011fu i\xe7in ayn\u0131 istek izin al\u0131r:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl -i http://127.0.0.1:9080/anything/res -H \'user: alice\'\\n```\\n\\nBeklenen durum kodu:\\n\\n```text\\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\\n{\\"message\\":\\"authorized\\"}\\n```\\n\\n## Payla\u015f\u0131lan politikay\u0131 g\xfcncelleme {#update-the-shared-policy}\\n\\n`bob` i\xe7in do\u011frudan bir izni `policy.csv` dosyas\u0131na ekleyin:\\n\\n```csv\\np, *, /anything, GET\\np, admin, *, *\\np, bob, /anything/res, GET\\ng, alice, admin\\n```\\n\\nEklenti metadata komutunu tekrar \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n. Bu metadata\'y\u0131 referans alan rotalar, rota yap\u0131land\u0131rmalar\u0131n\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftirmeden g\xfcncellenmi\u015f politikay\u0131 kullan\u0131r. \u0130ste\u011fi tekrarlay\u0131n:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl -i http://127.0.0.1:9080/anything/res -H \'user: bob\'\\n```\\n\\nBeklenen sonu\xe7 art\u0131k \u015f\xf6yledir:\\n\\n```text\\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\\n{\\"message\\":\\"authorized\\"}\\n```\\n\\n## Yap\u0131land\u0131rma kapsam\u0131n\u0131 se\xe7me {#choosing-the-configuration-scope}\\n\\nBirden fazla rota tek bir model ve politikay\u0131 payla\u015facaksa eklenti metadata\'s\u0131n\u0131 kullan\u0131n. Bir rota ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z bir yetkilendirme \u015fekline ihtiya\xe7 duyuyorsa rota-yerel bir model ve politika kullan\u0131n. Tam yap\u0131land\u0131rma \u015femas\u0131 ve dosya tabanl\u0131 alternatif i\xe7in [APISIX `authz-casbin` eklenti referans\u0131na](https://apisix.apache.org/docs/apisix/plugins/authz-casbin/) bak\u0131n.\\n\\n## Temizleme {#clean-up}\\n\\nTest rotas\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131n:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl --fail-with-body \\\\\\n  \\"http://127.0.0.1:9180/apisix/admin/routes/casbin-demo\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\"X-API-KEY: $admin_key\\" \\\\\\n  -X DELETE\\n```\\n\\nPayla\u015f\u0131lan eklenti metadata\'s\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131n:\\n\\n```sh\\ncurl --fail-with-body \\\\\\n  \\"http://127.0.0.1:9180/apisix/admin/plugin_metadata/authz-casbin\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\"X-API-KEY: $admin_key\\" \\\\\\n  -X DELETE\\n```"},{"id":"/2020/04/21/google-award","metadata":{"permalink":"/tr/blog/2020/04/21/google-award","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2020-04-21-google-award.md","source":"@site/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2020-04-21-google-award.md","title":"Yang Luo \u2014 Google Open Source Peer Bonus Kazanan\u0131","description":"Casbin\'in kurucusu Yang Luo\'nun, 2019 Q3 d\xf6neminde Casbin, Npcap ve Nmap \xfczerindeki \xe7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131 nedeniyle Google Open Source Peer Bonus \xf6d\xfcl\xfcn\xfc almaya hak kazand\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 duyurmaktan mutluluk duyar\u0131z.","date":"2020-04-21T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.81,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Casbin","title":"Official Account","url":"https://github.com/casbin","imageURL":"/tr/img/authors/casbin.png","key":"casbin","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Yang Luo \u2014 Google Open Source Peer Bonus Kazanan\u0131","authors":["casbin"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"APISIX\'te Casbin Kullanarak Yetkilendirme","permalink":"/tr/blog/2021/08/19/apisix-casbin-authorization"},"nextItem":{"title":"Dok\xfcmantasyonumuzun Yeniden D\xfczenlenmesi","permalink":"/tr/blog/2018/09/23/new-website"}},"content":"Casbin\'in kurucusu [Yang Luo](https://github.com/hsluoyz)\'nun, 2019 Q3 d\xf6neminde [Casbin](/), [Npcap](https://nmap.org/npcap/) ve [Nmap](https://nmap.org/) \xfczerindeki \xe7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131 nedeniyle [Google Open Source Peer Bonus](https://opensource.google.com/docs/growing/peer-bonus/) \xf6d\xfcl\xfcn\xfc almaya hak kazand\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 duyurmaktan mutluluk duyar\u0131z.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n![ospb](/img/blog/google-open-source-peer-bonus-award-letter.png)\\n\\n> Tam \xf6d\xfcl mektubuna [buradan](https://github.com/hsluoyz/hsluoyz.github.io/blob/master/download/Open%20Source%20Peer%20Bonus%20Q3%202019%20-%20Yang%20Luo%20-%20OSPB%20Award%20Letter.pdf) eri\u015febilirsiniz.\\n\\nGoogle program\u0131 \u015fu \u015fekilde tan\u0131ml\u0131yor:\\n\\n> _T\u0131pk\u0131 bir Google Peer Bonus\'un, beklenenin \xe7ok \xf6tesine ge\xe7en bir Googler\'\u0131 takdir etmesi gibi, Open Source Peer Bonus da a\xe7\u0131k kaynak projelere ola\u011fan\xfcst\xfc katk\u0131larda bulunan harici katk\u0131da bulunanlar\u0131 takdir eder._\\n\\n[2019 kazanan duyurusu](https://opensource.googleblog.com/2020/01/announcing-2019-second-cycle-google.html), Yang ve Casbin\'i; Git, TensorFlow, V8, CPython, LLVM, Apache projeleri, Angular ve Jenkins gibi di\u011fer etkili projeler ve geli\u015ftiricilerle birlikte listeliyor.\\n\\nCasbin\'in a\xe7\u0131k kaynak ve bulut g\xfcvenli\u011fi alan\u0131ndaki \xe7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131yla tan\u0131nmas\u0131ndan gurur duyuyoruz.\\n\\n_Casbin\'i tercih etti\u011finiz i\xe7in te\u015fekk\xfcrler!_"},{"id":"/2018/09/23/new-website","metadata":{"permalink":"/tr/blog/2018/09/23/new-website","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2018-09-23-new-website.md","source":"@site/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2018-09-23-new-website.md","title":"Dok\xfcmantasyonumuzun Yeniden D\xfczenlenmesi","description":"Casbin dok\xfcmantasyonunu GitHub Wiki\'den, Docusaurus ile desteklenen bu sitenin Docs b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcne ta\u015f\u0131d\u0131k. Daha iyi Markdown i\u015fleme, tam metin arama, versiyonlama ve \xe7eviri \xf6zelliklerine kavu\u015fursunuz.","date":"2018-09-23T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.21,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Yang Luo","title":"Creator of Casbin","url":"https://github.com/hsluoyz","imageURL":"/tr/img/authors/hsluoyz.png","key":"hsluoyz","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Dok\xfcmantasyonumuzun Yeniden D\xfczenlenmesi","authors":["hsluoyz"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Yang Luo \u2014 Google Open Source Peer Bonus Kazanan\u0131","permalink":"/tr/blog/2020/04/21/google-award"},"nextItem":{"title":"node-Casbin: Casbin Ailesinin Yeni \xdcyesi","permalink":"/tr/blog/2018/08/27/node-casbin"}},"content":"Casbin dok\xfcmantasyonunu GitHub Wiki\'den, Docusaurus ile desteklenen bu sitenin **Docs** b\xf6l\xfcm\xfcne ta\u015f\u0131d\u0131k. Daha iyi Markdown i\u015fleme, tam metin arama, versiyonlama ve \xe7eviri \xf6zelliklerine kavu\u015fursunuz.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\nDok\xfcmanlar h\xe2l\xe2 iyile\u015ftirilmektedir. Site kayna\u011f\u0131 GitHub\'da bulunabilir: https://github.com/apache/casbin-website\\n\\nKatk\u0131lar ve \xf6neriler memnuniyetle kar\u015f\u0131lan\u0131r."},{"id":"/2018/08/27/node-casbin","metadata":{"permalink":"/tr/blog/2018/08/27/node-casbin","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2018-08-27-node-casbin.md","source":"@site/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2018-08-27-node-casbin.md","title":"node-Casbin: Casbin Ailesinin Yeni \xdcyesi","description":"Casbin\'i Node.js\'e ta\u015f\u0131d\u0131k: node-Casbin.","date":"2018-08-27T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.29,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Zixuan Liu","title":"Casbin Maintainer","url":"https://github.com/nodece","imageURL":"/tr/img/authors/nodece.png","key":"nodece","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"node-Casbin: Casbin Ailesinin Yeni \xdcyesi","authors":["nodece"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Dok\xfcmantasyonumuzun Yeniden D\xfczenlenmesi","permalink":"/tr/blog/2018/09/23/new-website"},"nextItem":{"title":"**Casbin Server** Yay\u0131nland\u0131!","permalink":"/tr/blog/2018/08/07/launching-casbin-server"}},"content":"Casbin\'i Node.js\'e ta\u015f\u0131d\u0131k: [node-Casbin](https://github.com/apache/casbin-node-casbin).\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n**node-Casbin**, di\u011fer Casbin uygulamalar\u0131yla ayn\u0131 kullan\u0131m ve API\'yi korur. Express, Koa2 ve Egg.js i\xe7in ara katman yaz\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131 (middlewares) mevcuttur ve bir Sequelize depolama adapt\xf6r\xfc dahil edilmi\u015ftir.\\n\\nUmar\u0131z teknoloji y\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131n\u0131za (stack) uyum sa\u011flar. Geri bildirimleriniz ve katk\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131z memnuniyetle kar\u015f\u0131lan\u0131r.\\n\\nGitHub: https://github.com/apache/casbin-node-casbin"},{"id":"/2018/08/07/launching-casbin-server","metadata":{"permalink":"/tr/blog/2018/08/07/launching-casbin-server","editUrl":"https://github.com/apache/casbin-website/edit/master/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2018-08-07-launching-casbin-server.md","source":"@site/i18n/tr/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2018-08-07-launching-casbin-server.md","title":"**Casbin Server** Yay\u0131nland\u0131!","description":"\u0130nsanlar s\u0131kl\u0131kla Casbin\'in bir k\xfct\xfcphane yerine bir servis olarak \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131p \xe7al\u0131\u015famayaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 soruyor. Cevap evet. Somut bir Access Control as a Service \xe7\xf6z\xfcm\xfc olarak Casbin Server hizmete sunuldu.","date":"2018-08-07T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"readingTime":0.47,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Helong Zhang","title":"Casbin Maintainer","url":"https://github.com/BetaCat0","imageURL":"/tr/img/authors/BetaCat0.png","key":"BetaCat0","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"**Casbin Server** Yay\u0131nland\u0131!","authors":["BetaCat0"]},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"node-Casbin: Casbin Ailesinin Yeni \xdcyesi","permalink":"/tr/blog/2018/08/27/node-casbin"}},"content":"\u0130nsanlar s\u0131kl\u0131kla Casbin\'in bir k\xfct\xfcphane yerine bir servis olarak \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131p \xe7al\u0131\u015famayaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 soruyor. Cevap **evet**. Somut bir **Access Control as a Service** \xe7\xf6z\xfcm\xfc olarak [Casbin Server](https://github.com/apache/casbin-server) hizmete sunuldu.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n**Casbin Server**, \xe7ekirdek ekip taraf\u0131ndan aktif olarak geli\u015ftirilmektedir. Mevcut \xf6zellikler:\\n\\n- Go dilinde yaz\u0131lm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.\\n- Bir\xe7ok Casbin \xf6rne\u011fini y\xf6neterek, politika uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 birden fazla servisten merkezi hale getirebilirsiniz.\\n- T\xfcm istemci ileti\u015fimi i\xe7in **gRPC**; **REST** deste\u011fi planlanmaktad\u0131r.\\n- \xd6rnekleri, modelleri, politika depolamay\u0131 ve y\xfck dengelemeyi y\xf6netmek i\xe7in bir web y\xf6netim aray\xfcz\xfc.\\n\\nKaynak kodu: https://github.com/apache/casbin-server\\n\\nSorunlar (Issues) ve pull request\'ler memnuniyetle kar\u015f\u0131lan\u0131r."}]}}')}}]);